{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In GOPOGO, you are a small frog in a big pond, and there are great challenges ahead of you. You must become one with the pogostick, you will need to aim and time your jumps with great skill if you want to make it to the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique Jumping mechanic, easy to learn but hard to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 10 challenging levels to complete, each has a race challenge that follows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Play with friends in Multiplayer and Proximity Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Explore an Open World and Collect Golden Lilypads to Unlock Hats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Original Drum and Bass Soundtrack and Piano score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Level Replay System, watch your run after finishing a level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1481370?t=1745995177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1481370?t=1745995177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481370/e76612cc4c72961a14eb6a8100b5091301263172/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745995177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481370/e76612cc4c72961a14eb6a8100b5091301263172/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745995177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3588750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In GOPOGO, you are a small frog in a big pond, and there are great challenges ahead of you. You must become one with the pogostick, you